creatures:
- name: Priest
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 13  
      **Hit Points** 38 (rollable(dice=7d8 + 7,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** 30 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Initiative) (10)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Medicine rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Medicine Check), Perception rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Perception Check), Religion rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Religion Check)  
      **Gear** chain shirt, holy symbol, mace  
      **Senses** Passive Perception 15  
      **Languages** Common plus one other language  
      **Challenge** 2 (450 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The priest makes two attacks, using Mace or Radiant Flame in any combination.

      ***Mace.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Mace]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d6+3,dicelabel=Damage [Mace]) Bludgeoning damage plus rollable(dice=2d4,dicelabel=Damage [Mace]) Radiant damage.

      ***Radiant Flame.*** *Ranged Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Radiant Flame]), range 60 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d10,dicelabel=Damage [Radiant Flame]) Radiant damage.

      ***Spellcasting.*** The priest casts one of the following spells, using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability:

      At will: [Light](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618996-light), [Thaumaturgy](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619174-thaumaturgy)  
      1/day: [Spirit Guardians](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619078-spirit-guardians)  

      ***Divine Aid (3/Day).*** The priest casts [Bless](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618933-bless), [Dispel Magic](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619103-dispel-magic), [Healing Word](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619143-healing-word), or [Lesser Restoration](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619016-lesser-restoration), using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting.

      3/day: [Bless](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618933-bless), [Dispel Magic](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619103-dispel-magic), [Healing Word](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619143-healing-word), [Lesser Restoration](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619016-lesser-restoration)  

    type: custom
